      "note": "The dates are the span of the reign, not birth and death. EBSCO gives 1279 to 1213 BCE (astronomical -1278 to -1212); the older Encyclopedia.com entry gives 1304-1237 B.C. (-1303 to -1236), so start may be up to 25 years earlier and end up to 24 years earlier. Conversions use year = 1 - BCE."
